spare parts are discouraged by UFS 1-300-02: UNIFIED FACILITIES GUIDE SPECIFICATIONS 
(UFGS) FORMAT STANDARD, but some hard to replace or easily lost items may be 
warranted for inclusion.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
<OLG><BRK/>
<OLI>[_____]</OLI><BRK/>
